OL,3,AGerman far-right set for big win in
OL,4,Aeastern state, projections show
OL,5,
OL,6,FGermany's AfD is heading for a big
OL,7,Fvictory in the eastern state of
OL,8,FSaxony-Anhalt, far ahead of its
OL,9,Fmainstream rivals, according to initial
OL,10,Fprojections. It is not yet clear if
OL,11,Fthat would be enough to take power in
OL,12,Fthe state but the AfD says it has won a
OL,13,Fmandate to govern.
OL,15,FThe far-right Alternative for Germany
OL,16,Fis set to win 44% of the vote, well
OL,17,Fahead of the conservative CDU on 17.8%.
OL,19,FThe AfD's charismatic leader in the
OL,20,Fstate, Ulrich Siegmund, said it was
OL,21,F"sensational" and they wanted to start
OL,22,Fgoverning as soon as possible.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
