OL,3,AGerman far-right set for big win in
OL,4,Aeastern state, projections show
OL,5,
OL,6,FNo far-right party has won control of a
OL,7,FGerman state since World War Two, and
OL,8,Fgoverning at state level would mean
OL,9,Fpowers over policing, local education
OL,10,Fand culture.
